<td id="S2.T1.2.1.9.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">AM <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib157" title="" class="ltx_ref">Zhao et al., 2025a</a>)</cite></td>
<td id="S2.T1.2.1.9.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">1.4M</td>
<td id="S2.T1.2.1.9.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">
<span id="S2.T1.2.1.9.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block fa fa-check" aria-hidden="true">
